Runtime imports beyond numpy/torch/huggingface-hub: librosa, packaging, einops
(pack/unpack required), beartype, rotary-embedding-torch. No ml-collections,
PyYAML, external flash-attn, or training/CLI dependencies are needed.
Use PyTorch >=2 with scaled_dot_product_attention, weights_only loading,
torch.autocast and the legacy torch.backends.cuda.sdp_kernel context API.
RotaryEmbedding must support dim= and rotate_queries_or_keys; einops must
support pack/unpack (introduced in 0.6). These are API requirements, not new
version pins. Echora's runtime pins live in services/analysis/pyproject.toml.
